#   readable_byte_stream_controller - Streams::ReadableByteStreamController: its members and
#   the cancel, pull and release steps a stream calls
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Streams/ReadableByteStreamController.cpp (lines 24-211) and the
#       inline members of ReadableByteStreamController.h, as part of the ReadableStream stand-in
#       of DESIGN.md §3.6 (region p2s). Pull-into descriptors are only made by BYOB readers and
#       autoAllocateChunkSize (phase 4): a path that would make one traps.
